      "name": "razor831",
      "username": "razor831",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/8c91f0/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-06-20T18:15:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I put in my order this Sunday, set up shipping and all of that.&nbsp; Ordered Enhanced Edition, all of the Expansions, and all of the mini-expansions except for Ambuscade.&nbsp; Fifteen dollars for shipping, and so far my \"arrive by\" date according to FedEx is \"N/A\" and the last and only thing on the tracking log is from June 17 saying \"Shipment information sent to FedEx.\"&nbsp; I was really hoping to have the game by tonight for a gaming group.&nbsp; NOW I'm just hoping I get it at all...but that shipping price is a joke if I can't even find out where my 120 dollars worth of merchandise is...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: It just finally got picked up today.&nbsp; Let's see if it's here by Saturday...I hate FedEx...</p>",
